From 632da2047fb922a201680739e08f15a8dc16d9d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:18:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GameSpace: Build without the LineageOS SDK

AOSPA doesn't ship lineage-sdk:
- drop org.lineageos.platform.internal and LineagePreferenceLib
- the three finger swipe action is a LineageSettings key, so there is
  nothing to save and restore around a session; make it a no-op
- drop the bypass charge switch and its SelfRemovingSwitchPreference
  wrapper, since the framework side needs the LineageOS HealthInterface

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 app/src/main/Android.bp                       |  2 -
 .../SystemSettingSwitchPreference.java        | 54 -------------------
 .../gamespace/data/SystemSettings.kt          | 15 ++----
 .../gamespace/settings/SettingsFragment.kt    |  9 ----
 app/src/main/res/xml/root_preferences.xml     |  6 ---
 5 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 82 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 app/src/main/java/com/crdroid/settings/preferences/SystemSettingSwitchPreference.java

